<title>FRANCE: GdesEaux to sell most of G de Sante.</title>
<headline>GdesEaux to sell most of G de Sante.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Generale des Eaux will sell the bulk of unit Generale de Sante by the end of the year for at least 8.5 billion francs, chairman Jean-Marie Messier told a news conference on Thursday.</p>
<p>He said there were two potential buyers, BC Partners and Cinven, that the choice of buyer would be announced in the coming days and that the sale should be completed before the end</p>
</text>
